# Generated by `npm run art` — the contact sheet is a review surface, not a source.
#
# **Anchored.** Unanchored, `art/` also matches `src/render/art/`, which is where the entire
# art pipeline lives — so every new source file in it went invisible to git and would have
# been dropped from the commit while the working tree kept building and passing.
/art/
